{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NB: DEMO VERSION. Play the first chapter of Woven Horizons (English for the moment). Explore the map, try tactical combat, unlock attacks, and face your first minibosses.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/1703c51674eba6b741551445361be7ec.avif?t=1757607887\" width=613 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero destined to save the world. You are a treasure seeker, drawn by a shared dream of gold and mystery. You awaken in Nadia\u2019s inn, where every villager dreams of a hidden treasure guarded by dark forces. Drawn by the call, you embark on a roguelite journey, facing tactical battles, gathering relics, and returning stronger after each fall. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/57daf31bf167f301b10e3aceed6c7bc0.avif?t=1757607887\" width=613 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Combat uses an action point system (AP)</u></strong>: some attacks consume AP, while others regenerate it. Certain abilities have cooldowns, forcing players to manage resources and timing. Here, it\u2019s not your heroes who level up\u2014it\u2019s their attacks. Each one gains experience and can evolve through different upgrade paths, letting you shape unique builds and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/cf8a3799d06a3928f81fd9195747f3a6.poster.avif?t=1757607887\" width=780 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/cf8a3799d06a3928f81fd9195747f3a6.webm?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/cf8a3799d06a3928f81fd9195747f3a6.mp4?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle uses a unique <u><strong>timeline-based system</strong></u> that evolves with each chapter. In Chapter I, for example, a day-night cycle affects the timeline \u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf19. New monsters may appear at night, while others may gain new abilities, become enraged, or weaken. Players must manage time and adapt their strategies accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/684d0d31e3f98f4ea226e0b3ff778d07.avif?t=1757607887\" width=1271 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/f4d605ffd9523a871da46bb22856feed.poster.avif?t=1757607887\" width=780 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/f4d605ffd9523a871da46bb22856feed.webm?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/f4d605ffd9523a871da46bb22856feed.mp4?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat enhanced with dynamic <u><strong>Quick Time Events in Combat (QTE)</strong></u> that test your reflexes. Face a variety of QTE types, each bringing unique challenges to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/5d4e2c7a9bca0a4900f079ba92c6487e.poster.avif?t=1757607887\" width=780 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/5d4e2c7a9bca0a4900f079ba92c6487e.webm?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/5d4e2c7a9bca0a4900f079ba92c6487e.mp4?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/c1355adca4e832d70bd0ac686d2e2d8c.poster.avif?t=1757607887\" width=780 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/c1355adca4e832d70bd0ac686d2e2d8c.webm?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/c1355adca4e832d70bd0ac686d2e2d8c.mp4?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/295d24602a7f425fdcc12406ae3e2846.avif?t=1757607887\" width=613 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a branching map and choose your path from 30+ events: battles, new attacks, shops, upgrades, equipment, or mini-games. Progress through 4 chapters of fights, minibosses, and unique bosses. Each run lets you improve, discover strategies, and earn tokens to unlock new power for the next journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/954d0e1d980213bdc873daa00ea70994.poster.avif?t=1757607887\" width=1170 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/954d0e1d980213bdc873daa00ea70994.webm?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955760?t=1757607887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/0e69f19a2bf37c424bbfea69301749d95fbf0687/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757607887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/c5619ec4bdbdaca79628520c1c6f7628813b3803/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757607887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/c5619ec4bdbdaca79628520c1c6f7628813b3803/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757607887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NB: DEMO VERSION. Play the first chapter of Woven Horizons (English for the moment). Explore the map, try tactical combat, unlock attacks, and face your first minibosses.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/1703c51674eba6b741551445361be7ec.avif?t=1757607887\" width=613 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero destined to save the world. You are a treasure seeker, drawn by a shared dream of gold and mystery. You awaken in Nadia\u2019s inn, where every villager dreams of a hidden treasure guarded by dark forces. Drawn by the call, you embark on a roguelite journey, facing tactical battles, gathering relics, and returning stronger after each fall. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/57daf31bf167f301b10e3aceed6c7bc0.avif?t=1757607887\" width=613 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Combat uses an action point system (AP)</u></strong>: some attacks consume AP, while others regenerate it. Certain abilities have cooldowns, forcing players to manage resources and timing. Here, it\u2019s not your heroes who level up\u2014it\u2019s their attacks. Each one gains experience and can evolve through different upgrade paths, letting you shape unique builds and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/cf8a3799d06a3928f81fd9195747f3a6.poster.avif?t=1757607887\" width=780 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/cf8a3799d06a3928f81fd9195747f3a6.webm?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/cf8a3799d06a3928f81fd9195747f3a6.mp4?t=1757607887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle uses a unique <u><strong>timeline-based system</strong></u> that evolves with each chapter. In Chapter I, for example, a day-night cycle affects the timeline \u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf19. New monsters may appear at night, while others may gain new abilities, become enraged, or weaken. Players must manage time and adapt their strategies accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/684d0d31e3f98f4ea226e0b3ff778d07.avif?t=1757607887\" width=1271 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955760/extras/f4d605ffd9523a